   "title": "SETUP",
   "headline": "A MODEL, NOT A BATTERY",
   "narration_text": "I'm Tanmay Kulkarni, in for Humanitarians AI. I did not open a real battery. I built a model of a coin cell from two manufacturers' published graphs, and I ask it one thing: how much is left when the device resets?",
