   "title": "THE LIMIT",
   "headline": "WHAT THIS IS NOT",
   "narration_text": "Let me be plain about what this is. It is a model fitted to graphs I read, and I tested no real cell. Cold would make it worse, and I did not model a capacitor. And my reset line is my own choice, so the shape is the claim, not the exact numbers.",
